msgstr "Curso nuevo"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/course_form.html:9
msgid "Back to courses"
msgstr "Volver a los cursos"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/course_form.html:28
msgid ""
"Leave this on until the year is ready. You can schedule it once it has "
"material."
msgstr ""
"Déjalo marcado hasta que el curso esté listo. Podrás programarlo cuando "
"tenga material."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/course_form.html:31
msgid ""
"One section per line. These are the divisions of the course, such as "
"theory and lab work."
msgstr ""
"Una categoría por línea. Son las divisiones del curso, como teoría y "
"prácticas."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/course_form.html:42
