msgstr "¿Eliminar este curso y todo lo que contiene?"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/courses.html:56
msgid "Name of the new course"
msgstr "Nombre del curso nuevo"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/courses.html:57
msgid "Everything is copied withheld, so nothing is released before you say so."
msgstr "Se copia todo retenido, así que no se publica nada hasta que tú lo digas."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/courses.html:59
msgid "Copy course"
msgstr "Copiar curso"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/courses.html:65
msgid "No courses yet."
msgstr "Todavía no hay cursos."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/page_form.html:37
msgid "Markdown. Tables, footnotes and existing HTML are all kept."
msgstr ""
"Markdown. Se conservan las tablas, las notas al pie y el HTML que ya "
"hubiera.Markdown. Se conservan las tablas, las notas al pie y el HTML que"
" ya hubiera."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/page_form.html:44
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Vista previa"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/page_form.html:66
msgid ""
"Attachments inherit this page. They are refused until it is released, to "
"a link that was forwarded exactly as to a guess."
msgstr ""
"Los adjuntos heredan la visibilidad de la página. Hasta que se libere se "
"rechazan igual a un enlace reenviado que a una URL adivinada."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/page_form.html:75
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Abrir"

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/page_form.html:79
msgid "Remove this file? The stored copy goes with it."
msgstr "¿Eliminar este archivo? La copia guardada se va con él."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/page_form.html:86
msgid "No files attached to this page."
msgstr "Esta página no tiene archivos adjuntos."

#: src/splent_io/splent_feature_courses/templates/courses/admin/page_form.html:103
